###############
   "Answers"
###############


    A. Complement can be reached by flipping to the opposite (~, or ^ with all 1s)
    
    R  G  B  Color  ~Complement   Color
   --------------------------------------
    0  0  0  Black    1  1  1     White
    0  0  1  Blue     1  1  0     Yellow
    0  1  0  Green    1  0  1     Magenta
    0  1  1  Cyan     1  0  0     Red
    1  0  0  Red      0  1  1     Cyan
    1  0  1  Magenta  0  1  0     Green
    1  1  0  Yellow   0  0  1     Blue
    1  1  1  White    0  0  0     Black

###############

    B. Describe each operation's impact on the color:

       Blue   |  Green   = Cyan
       Yellow &  Cyan    = Green
       Red    ^  Magenta = Blue

      Refresher:  |  =  OR
                  &  =  AND
                  ^  =  XOR
                  ~  =  NOT
